WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Lin Xia, please sit at our table, okay, okay

2
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,380
No wonder Huzi didn't like your sister

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,060
It turns out that he and Lin Zhiqing have an affair. Xiao Ming, we will be a family from now on. I would like to advise you.

4
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:18,140
Stop worrying about Lin Zhiqing, right. We are all family, right?

5
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:21,020
When Huzi and Lin Xia started a small business before, his face turned red whenever he said a word.

6
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:22,500
Now we're holding hands

7
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,820
This is the rebirth of love, Dad

8
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,780
I can't go into the mountains even if I plant this for half a month.

9
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,390
We can't just endure it

10
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:33,540
But coming tomorrow will break the rules in the mountains.

11
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,820
We can go to town and find someone to go away with.

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,500
Li Laowai in town

13
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,860
We used to drink together often

14
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:50,170
Remember to bring 20 yuan for a bottle of Erguotou. It’s not expensive. I understand, Daddy.

15
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:51,890
Lin Xia is so beautiful.

16
00:00:52,210 --> 00:00:53,570
How did you catch them?

17
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:55,590
Second sister, please stop calling.

18
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:57,510
Huzi and I are good friends and partners.

19
00:00:58,220 --> 00:00:59,260
People dislike me

20
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:02,540
I don’t know how this stupid big brother next to Zhong Di and Wei Zhu still looks down on my sister-in-law.

21
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:08,860
There is a street lined up with people who like my sister-in-law in the provincial capital. Which one is not better than her? Lin Xia, my tiger son said that you two should be bastards.

22
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,520
Where did your niece come from?

23
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,890
Don’t you have a bad relationship with your brother? Huzi said

24
00:01:24,090 --> 00:01:28,000
My sister-in-law's bad relationship with my father has nothing to do with me, right?

25
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:40,400
My father is the new county magistrate of Yuqing. If you treat me better and want to go through the back door later, your father will send you back to the county to freeze a house.

26
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:47,560
Lin Xiaoyou's scream is like killing a pig. I didn't even freeze the room. Where can I apologize? I guess it's because those two bear eggs are too fierce. She is good-looking. If I can marry such a wife, I can live a long life.
